  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.70",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.70\n\nReleased on 2026-11-19.\n\nProjects with many SVG references or large sets of variables compile faster, and files whose path holds a tab join again. A provider key in your own project's .env file is used again, as the docs describe.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Media Use:** Recipe, prefs and SFX lines show control characters as escapes ([36b60d18b4](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/36b60d18b488999a36748693ef04fc3516e40aa4), [#8202](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8202)).\n- **Render:** Keep segment checkpoints in the local cache ([e5283f63b9](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e5283f63b90dfe1bd4da45391dcd6969d3475462), [#8137](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8137)).\n- **Skills:** Raise the launcher minimum to 0.9.68 ([a4995e9e6f](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a4995e9e6f3856292bf957e5b376600a634b918c), [#8232](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8232)).\n- **Studio:** A sealed preview's timeline shows its text clips' words and look ([1cf98cf892](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1cf98cf892d3a6e409637cdda1ac209a2782d489), [#8228](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8228)).\n- **Parsers:** Join files whose path holds a tab again ([4abbdc3e0d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4abbdc3e0d6d592ae0ea13509bb7979ba1b15157), [#8227](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8227)).\n- **Compiler:** Compiling a composition's variables stays fast as the input grows ([12b83e9283](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/12b83e9283c0e423046204160fac703341f36558), [#8226](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8226)).\n- **Engine:** Files whose path holds a line break are not joined ([089e5f6b49](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/089e5f6b4911f95880d9fd1012aa0f87b6d7e622), [#8219](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8219)).\n- **Producer:** Raise the sub-composition expansion limit to 64 MB ([4d17b71b4d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4d17b71b4d6801e19473e8f6cf260e0e63f0bf70), [#8096](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8096)).\n- **Studio:** A sealed preview shows its loading overlay while media still loads ([81f89b8150](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/81f89b81504bd37caedd52512972ec2aa5349f91), [#8184](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8184)).\n- **CLI:** A provider key in your own or a cloned project's .env is used again. Only a project someone sent you gives way to your own key ([8ace95ce94](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8ace95ce949b953224b164833b84495edecb2eb7), [#8099](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8099)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Core:** Rewriting SVG attribute selectors stays fast with many references ([c672ef0e5d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c672ef0e5d03a9f7410db7352172bd8fc75ddde6), [#8216](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8216)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Producer:** Size the expansion-limit tests from the limit constant ([4be5ba2aad](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4be5ba2aad7da643ab028ea38fe633f66d7a8344), [#8223](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8223)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.69...v0.9.70\n"
}
